{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20400",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.3,
      "end_seconds": 7.34,
      "duration_seconds": 6.04,
      "text": "Hello doctor, sorry, I took a wrong turn on the way here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.99,
      "end_seconds": 12.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.42,
      "end_seconds": 23.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "I wanted to get stiffness in the hip after sitting looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.17,
      "end_seconds": 26.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.31,
      "end_seconds": 30.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Probably about a month. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.99,
      "end_seconds": 41.37,
      "duration_seconds": 10.38,
      "text": "Hm, okay. Right, tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.19,
      "end_seconds": 51.27,
      "duration_seconds": 8.08,
      "text": "It sort of comes and goes. Mostly mild. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.88,
      "end_seconds": 60.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Any pain in your right groin as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.71,
      "end_seconds": 65.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Yes, about the same, three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.9,
      "end_seconds": 68.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "How much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.41,
      "end_seconds": 71.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.0,
      "text": "Mostly moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.72,
      "end_seconds": 80.12,
      "duration_seconds": 7.4,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any swelling of the leg, numbness in the leg or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.82,
      "end_seconds": 83.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.4,
      "end_seconds": 88.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Right, and what about fall or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.63,
      "end_seconds": 94.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.19,
      "end_seconds": 98.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.97,
      "end_seconds": 101.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.45,
      "end_seconds": 107.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "Right, any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.98,
      "end_seconds": 113.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Let me think, no, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.02,
      "end_seconds": 130.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.77,
      "end_seconds": 137.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "Diclofenac, 50 milligrams, when needed for the joint pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.47,
      "end_seconds": 150.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.29,
      "end_seconds": 161.62,
      "duration_seconds": 10.33,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. I swim twice a week. I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.31,
      "end_seconds": 165.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.95,
      "end_seconds": 170.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "I've got arthritis in my knees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.27,
      "end_seconds": 174.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.18,
      "end_seconds": 178.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Hmm, no allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.73,
      "end_seconds": 190.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.85,
      "end_seconds": 201.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.34,
      "end_seconds": 221.53,
      "duration_seconds": 7.19,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 65, BP is 124 over 73, respiratory rate 16, oxygen saturation is 97 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.73,
      "end_seconds": 226.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.0,
      "end_seconds": 230.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "That's fine, I'll explain it soon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.32,
      "end_seconds": 234.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "May I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.09,
      "end_seconds": 236.04,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.19,
      "end_seconds": 238.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.85,
      "end_seconds": 253.01,
      "duration_seconds": 6.16,
      "text": "Rotation of the right hip is painful and limited compared with the left."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 255.0,
      "end_seconds": 256.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.42,
      "end_seconds": 267.01,
      "duration_seconds": 8.59,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check. Putting it all together, the most likely explanation is osteoarthritis of the right hip."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.73,
      "end_seconds": 271.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Mm, is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.52,
      "end_seconds": 286.08,
      "duration_seconds": 13.56,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like osteoarthritis of the right hip, but I'd like to confirm. I'd like to arrange a hip X-ray for hip pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 287.93,
      "end_seconds": 291.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "The earliest is Tuesday, 11:30 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 292.87,
      "end_seconds": 293.82,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "That's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.63,
      "end_seconds": 328.35,
      "duration_seconds": 33.72,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange blood tests for joint pain. You'll be taking paracetamol, 1 gram, up to four times a day, long term. That's for hip pain. Losing even a few kilos takes a lot of load off the hip. Keep walking in short regular bursts and use a stick in the opposite hand. Please don't wait if the symptoms get worse. That's when to be seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 329.23,
      "end_seconds": 332.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Let me think, thank you, that's clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.35,
      "end_seconds": 336.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "We'll catch up in six weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.53,
      "end_seconds": 340.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Good, I'll return then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 341.74,
      "end_seconds": 346.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "What are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.82,
      "end_seconds": 359.04,
      "duration_seconds": 12.22,
      "text": "So, I take the paracetamol, 1 gram, up to four times a day and come back in six weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 359.6,
      "end_seconds": 363.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 365.13,
      "end_seconds": 367.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}